---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
---
<section class="admin-panel" id="panel-products" data-admin-panel="products">
	<div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Productos personalizables</h2><p>Administra el catálogo que aparece en Servicios Extras.</p></div><button class="primary-button" data-create="product" type="button">+ Agregar producto</button></div>
	<section class="exchange-rate-card" aria-labelledby="exchange-rate-heading">
		<div><h3 id="exchange-rate-heading">Conversión de moneda</h3><p>Este valor se usa para mostrar en CUP los precios de planes y productos.</p></div>
		<form id="exchange-rate-form" class="exchange-rate-form">
			<label for="cup-per-usd">1 USD equivale a</label>
			<div class="exchange-rate-controls"><input id="cup-per-usd" name="cupPerUsd" type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" required /><span>CUP</span><button class="primary-button" type="submit">Guardar valor</button></div>
		</form>
	</section>
	<section class="category-cover-manager products-card-manager" aria-labelledby="products-card-heading">
		<div class="category-cover-heading"><h3 id="products-card-heading">Imagen de la tarjeta pública</h3><p>Cambia la imagen horizontal de “Productos personalizables” que aparece en Servicios Extras.</p></div>
		<form class="products-card-image-form" id="products-card-image-form">
			<div class="image-picker"><img id="products-card-image-preview" src={`${base}img/camisa.avif`} alt="Vista previa de la tarjeta de productos" /><label class="small-button" for="products-card-image-file">Seleccionar imagen</label><input id="products-card-image-file" type="file" accept="image/*" required /></div>
			<span class="field-hint">La imagen se optimizará y guardará en Supabase Storage.</span>
			<div class="about-save-row"><button class="primary-button" type="submit">Guardar imagen</button></div>
		</form>
	</section>
	<div class="managed-list" id="products-list"></div>
</section>
